{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "环跳屈髋取穴，三寸针深抵骨旁/关节；可行吸提呼推之呼吸补泻。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb30", "method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c01", "evidence_quote": "这叫做呼吸补泻", "seg_from": 6, "seg_to": 15, "start_s": 21.92, "end_s": 116.835, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=21s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 21.92, "end_s": 116.83}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "骨病初起常先见环跳痛；单纯神经痛针一两次可消，久痛须排查骨损/骨癌。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb30", "zangfu.gu"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c01", "evidence_quote": "一定是在环跳有痛", "seg_from": 29, "seg_to": 43, "start_s": 175.06, "end_s": 268.61, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=175s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 175.06, "end_s": 268.61}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "肩与对环跳：肩痛可刺对侧环跳；亦用于半身不遂。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb30"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c01", "evidence_quote": "我们扎环跳对策一阵下去", "seg_from": 47, "seg_to": 53, "start_s": 290.07, "end_s": 331.705, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=290s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 290.07, "end_s": 331.7}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "对策=对侧", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "风市取膝外上七寸，与环跳同为中风瘫痪大穴；中渎在其下二寸，助治麻痹不仁。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb31", "acupoint.gb30", "syndrome.zhong_feng"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c02", "evidence_quote": "都是治疗中封的大穴", "seg_from": 65, "seg_to": 71, "start_s": 407.2, "end_s": 452.675, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=407s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 407.2, "end_s": 452.68}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "风刺/风式=风市；中封=中风", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "阳陵泉为胆经合穴，凡筋病（膝不得屈伸、抽筋等）皆可取之。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb34", "zangfu.jin", "meridian.gb"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c03", "evidence_quote": "阳陵泉就是胆经的和穴", "seg_from": 125, "seg_to": 261, "start_s": 724.37, "end_s": 1411.556, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=724s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 724.37, "end_s": 1411.56}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "和穴=合穴", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "外丘治狂走、抽筋、脚痛；局部被咬伤可灸外丘助解毒。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb36"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c03", "evidence_quote": "这个穴道我们称之为外丘墟", "seg_from": 167, "seg_to": 205, "start_s": 913.53, "end_s": 1119.9, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=913s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 913.53, "end_s": 1119.9}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "外丘墟=外丘", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "光明为胆经络穴，外踝上五寸直刺，主眼科目疾。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb37"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c04", "evidence_quote": "大部分我们眼睛眼科的治症", "seg_from": 226, "seg_to": 230, "start_s": 1222.601, "end_s": 1264.186, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=1222s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 1222.6, "end_s": 1264.19}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-051.kp0008", "video_id": "zj-051", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "悬钟又名绝骨，治骨髓病与中风；可在穴区寻压痛点下针。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.gb39", "syndrome.zhong_feng"], "chapter_id": "zj-051.c04", "evidence_quote": "在绝骨穴上治疗", "seg_from": 281, "seg_to": 326, "start_s": 1512.161, "end_s": 1737.931, "citation": {"youtube_id": "eJs10gOlE8w", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eJs10gOlE8w&t=1512s", "series": "zj", "episode": 51, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Disciplines\" \"Acupuncture\" Complete 90 Episodes - Acupuncture 51", "start_s": 1512.16, "end_s": 1737.93}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
